# Firmware — never commit, and nothing derived from a stock OS.
*.syx
*.bin
*.snap
*.syx.json
*.syx.map.json

# Built mods, parked/superseded release builds and other outputs. The release
# repo ships the .elemods; the source repo does not track them.
*.elemod
*.work
*.o
mods/*/out/

# Local session notes (kept on disk, not in the repo)
HANDOFF.md

# Python bytecode
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# OS cruft
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
